ng those technologies from the  Commons for the common good unless we  change how technology is funded today we  can't fix this problem because this is  not a technology problem if we want a  different society if we want different  ideologies amplified then we need to  fund them differently we need to build  them differently and then we have a  chance of a progressive future
 

